    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming 2 bed townhouse in highly sought after town centre location\r\n\r\nSituated in a highly convenient and established location just moments from Gorey town centre, this charming traditional residence offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a home with character, convenience and town centre living.\r\n\r\nThe property has a distinctive traditional façade, with attractive natural stonework & brick detailing. Internally, the accommodation has a warm and welcoming feel, with a bright living room featuring a traditional-style solid-fuel stove set into an attractive brick fireplace, a well-equipped kitchen/dining room with a good range of fitted units & generous worktop space. Upstairs the property boasts two double bedrooms and a newly renovated shower room. \r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a private rear yard with useful ancillary storage and attractive stone boundary walls. This outdoor space also has the added benefit of a sunny southern orientation along with access to the rear lane.\r\n\r\nOne of the property's greatest attractions is undoubtedly its exceptional town centre location. From Centenary Place, residents can enjoy the convenience of having Gorey's extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities close at hand. All of the town’s schools, both primary & secondary, are within easy reach, along with both bus & rail connections. For buyers looking for a property that combines traditional charm with an exceptionally convenient urban lifestyle, Centenary Place is a particularly appealing proposition. Given its exceptional location, warm & cosy feel as well as the well equipped living space, this property would be ideally suited for those looking for a starter home, town centre downsize or even as an investment property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Sitting room            \t4.2m x 4.4m\r\nFeature fireplace with insert stove.\r\nKitchen/dining area\t3.9m x 3.7m\r\nRange of fitted wall & floor units, electric cooker, tiled splashback, extractor fan,fridge/freezer, washing machine, partly tiled walls, door to rear. \r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding\t\t\t\r\nHotpress\r\nPrimary bedroom \t\t2.7m x 4.3m\r\nFitted shelving & storage.\r\nBedroom 2\t\t\t2.1m x 3.5m\r\nBathroom\t\t\t1.6m x 2.7m\r\nFully tiled walk in shower, WC, WHB, tiled floor & walls."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tAll mains services \r\n•\tOil fired central heating\r\n•\tFully enclosed south facing rear garden with access to rear lane\r\n•\tBlock built garden store\r\n•\tOn-street parking to front\r\n•\tWalking distance of all town amenities"
